 meeting and accounts (minutes-equivalent) release. Monetary-policy decisio
 ns are timed at 14:15 CET with the press conference at 14:45 CET. ECB staf
 f macroeconomic projections are published alongside decisions in March\, J
 une\, September\, and December.\n\nCould not fully verify in this refresh:
  Upcoming European Central Bank (ECB) Governing Council monetary policy me
 eting dates and accounts (minutes equivalent) release dates during 2026 an
 d 2027. For each meeting include: the policy decision day with statement a
 t 14:15 CET and press conference at 14:45 CET\, and the corresponding mone
 tary policy accounts release approximately four weeks after the meeting. E
 CB staff macroeconomic projections are published alongside the March\, Jun
 e\, September\, and D
